cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the paper below."
title: "Circuit Oracle"
abstract: >-
  An LLM agent that reads a transcoder attribution graph of a subject model and
  answers safety-relevant questions about that model's internal computation.
  Evaluated on three proxy tasks: spurious probe features, secret elicitation,
  and suppression jailbreaking.
